Domain Entity StaffIdentity
documentation "This entity holds different identity codes for staff."
domain entity Staff
    documentation "A reference to the staff."
    is part of identity
descriptor StaffIdentificationSystem
    documentation "A coding scheme that is used for identification and record-keeping purposes by schools, LEAs, SEAs, or other agencies to refer to a staff."
    is part of identity
domain entity EducationOrganization
    documentation "A reference to the education organization representing the context of the staff information."
    is part of identity
shared string IdentificationCode
    documentation "A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to an individual by a school, LEA, SEA, or other agency."
    is optional
shared string AssigningOrganizationIdentificationCode
    documentation "The organization code or name assigning the identification code."
    is optional
date BeginDate
    documentation "Month, day, and year of the first day the identification code is effective."
    is optional
date EndDate
    documentation "Month, day, and year of the last day the identification code is effective."
    is optional
